1
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:26,860
Aiming for the sunset floating
over the Nakagawa River,

2
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:34,000
I kick a pebble and my shoes fly off too,

3
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:42,240
right onto the head of a
carpenter who was out jogging.

4
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:48,460
They laugh at me for
still being a kid at heart.

5
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:55,560
Even if you lose your spirit among strangers,
it's Katsushika, Kameari.

6
00:00:55,560 --> 00:01:02,540
A yawn here, the same as always.
The streets feel strangely kind.

7
00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:10,440
From the pointed-hat water tower,

8
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:16,800
the sunset drops down into the vast sky.

9
00:01:20,340 --> 00:01:25,260
Why does tomorrow have to end too

10
00:01:25,260 --> 00:01:30,280
Katsushika, Shibamata,
even happiness gets lost again.

11
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:33,860
Because I'm a fool who finally realized it.

12
00:01:51,140 --> 00:01:52,580
Reiko-chan.

13
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,820
Grandpa. Good morning.

14
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,840
Reiko-chan, you're looking cute again today.

15
00:01:56,980 --> 00:01:58,940
Especially that miniskirt uniform.

16
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:00,700
It really suits you, doesn't it?

17
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:01,460
Exactly, exactly.

18
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,940
Thanks, Grandpa. See you.

19
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:08,680
Lucky me.

20
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:09,520
Reiko-chan.

21
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,420
You always look so dashing.

22
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:13,881
Every time I see those thighs of yours,

23
00:02:13,931 --> 00:02:16,640
I feel like I'm getting a little younger.

24
00:02:17,220 --> 00:02:19,100
I'm so grateful, so grateful.

25
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:24,000
Many thousands, many thousands.

26
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:33,440
Run! Reiko's Great Chase

27
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:43,220
Ryo-san, that's the one.

28
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:46,820
If we knock it down carelessly,
it'll break into pieces.

29
00:02:47,380 --> 00:02:49,240
Somehow get it for me, Ryo-san.

30
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:52,840
If we piggyback,
we might be able to reach it.

31
00:02:53,270 --> 00:02:54,600
Reiko, get on my back.

32
00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:56,660
Why do I have to be the one on top?

33
00:02:56,660 --> 00:02:58,660
Because you're lighter, obviously.

34
00:02:58,660 --> 00:03:01,100
No way, Ryo-chan, you get on top.

35
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:04,180
Reiko, you're on the bottom?
Are you sure you'll be okay?

36
00:03:04,780 --> 00:03:05,480
Fine by me.

37
00:03:05,940 --> 00:03:07,140
I'm heavy, you know.

38
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:13,660
Hey, Ryo-chan, don't mess up my hair!

39
00:03:13,660 --> 00:03:15,820
I just washed it this morning, you know.

40
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:18,700
Sorry, sorry. Then lift me up.

41
00:03:20,740 --> 00:03:22,200
You're not going up at all!

42
00:03:22,820 --> 00:03:23,620
Wait a second.

43
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:28,060
How about now? I'm getting a little higher.

44
00:03:28,060 --> 00:03:30,880
Ow! Your hand's caught in my hair!

45
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:32,940
Hey, you're a noisy one, aren't you?

46
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:38,980
Hang in there, Rengo! It's for the kids!

47
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,540
You're really heavy.

48
00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:44,080
Hey, stop that!

49
00:03:45,820 --> 00:03:48,520
Don't press your chest against me!
You're giving too much service!

50
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:49,480
Whoa!

51
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:50,700
Whoa!

52
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:51,300
Ugh!

53
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:52,500
Whoa!

54
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:55,280
Whoa! Direct hit to the head!

55
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:59,160
Sorry! Ryo-chan, are you okay?

56
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,120
Are you okay?

57
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:41,720
Yes!

58
00:04:42,340 --> 00:04:43,660
What's wrong, Ryo-chan?

59
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:46,320
Snap out of it, Ryo-chan!

60
00:04:46,940 --> 00:04:49,040
Are you trying to kill me?

61
00:04:49,780 --> 00:04:52,360
I just accidentally put too much force into my legs,
that's all.

62
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:54,300
That was a full-on neck breaker!

63
00:04:54,300 --> 00:04:57,380
If it had been 10 seconds longer,
I would have definitely died.

64
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,860
I already said I'm sorry, didn't I?

65
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:02,540
No, I nearly died!

66
00:05:02,540 --> 00:05:05,100
You're just showing off
those long legs of yours.

67
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:07,520
Wearing a miniskirt like that is just wrong.

68
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:12,400
Argh, no! It's just easier to move around in,
that's all.

69
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:23,660
Yeah, right. Senior Reiko is so active, that's why she wears a mini. Don't be ridiculous!
A skirt that short only makes men feel lewd, and it's no use for anything.

70
00:05:23,660 --> 00:05:28,940
What did you just say? I don't want to hear that from you,
Ryo-chan, when you don't even understand fashion!

71
00:05:29,330 --> 00:05:32,780
I'm not some gal. If you're going to be disrespectful,
at least be properly disrespectful about it!

72
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:40,220
Ahh...

73
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,280
This is bad, senior.

74
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:46,580
Reiko-san was really angry, you know.

75
00:05:46,580 --> 00:05:47,900
You think she'll find out?

76
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,220
Good morning.

77
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:57,680
Reiko isn't here yet, is she?

78
00:05:57,960 --> 00:06:00,300
Reiko? I wouldn't know.

79
00:06:00,300 --> 00:06:02,020
What's wrong, Ryo-sama?

80
00:06:03,020 --> 00:06:04,520
Well, that's the thing...

81
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:05,220
Morning.

82
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:12,700
Reiko, did you give up the miniskirt?

83
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:16,980
Yes, some old man said minis weren't allowed,
so I did.

84
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,940
Maria, this is the
thing you asked me to get.

85
00:06:19,940 --> 00:06:22,440
You managed to get it? How wonderful!

86
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:23,380
What's that supposed to be?

87
00:06:23,380 --> 00:06:25,120
I had ordered shampoo.

88
00:06:26,020 --> 00:06:27,840
It was hard to find one that suited me.

89
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:30,740
It's the brand used at
a beauty salon in Paris.

90
00:06:30,740 --> 00:06:34,140
W-we're talking about shampoo,
and you had it shipped from Paris?

91
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:36,240
I always just use soap.

92
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:41,000
It's a woman's life! Don't compare it
to a scrubbing brush like your head.

93
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,400
You always have to say
something that gets on my nerves.

94
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:46,620
I also have something to give to Ryo-chan.

95
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:50,140
I've got plenty of shampoo already.

96
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:54,278
Who'd give you shampoo, Ryo-chan?

97
00:06:54,328 --> 00:06:55,340
Look inside.

98
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,480
W-what is this?

99
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:03,520
It's issued every year, but since you never go pick it up,
I got it from the station for you.

100
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,240
I don't want it.

101
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:06,660
That's not how it works.

102
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:10,420
You said that if I'm going to be disrespectful,
I should dress the part.

103
00:07:10,420 --> 00:07:13,640
So you should dress like a proper officer too,
Ryo-chan.

104
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:15,900
This is fine for me.

105
00:07:15,900 --> 00:07:16,860
How is that fine?

106
00:07:16,860 --> 00:07:17,980
No cap.

107
00:07:18,380 --> 00:07:19,200
Sleeves rolled up.

108
00:07:19,620 --> 00:07:21,100
Barefoot in bathroom sandals.

109
00:07:21,980 --> 00:07:24,320
How on earth is that a police officer?

110
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:25,220
Shut up.

111
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:27,220
This is my trademark.

112
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:31,220
That's exactly why everyone
recognizes me at a glance.

113
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:32,700
For example,

114
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:33,900
like this.

115
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:37,280
Hurry up and run!

116
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:38,680
Come on, hurry!

117
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:39,540
Get up!

118
00:07:46,380 --> 00:07:48,300
Oh crap, it's Kankichi Ryotsu!

119
00:07:48,300 --> 00:07:49,940
We've got no chance, run!

120
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:52,040
Did you really think
you could escape from me?

121
00:07:52,040 --> 00:08:01,300
Thanks a lot, Ryo-san.

122
00:08:01,300 --> 00:08:01,800
Thank you very much.

123
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,940
It's all right now.

124
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:05,767
So then,

125
00:08:05,817 --> 00:08:09,250
if I wore my uniform and cap properly,

126
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:11,120
nobody would realize the culprit is me.

127
00:08:11,500 --> 00:08:12,180
It's a scam!

128
00:08:13,060 --> 00:08:15,400
Hey, hurry up and run!

129
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,080
Come on, hurry!

130
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:17,860
Get up!

131
00:08:24,380 --> 00:08:25,940
What, just a cop?

132
00:08:26,180 --> 00:08:27,320
Shoot him, Wang!

133
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:31,960
It could come to that.

134
00:08:32,560 --> 00:08:33,860
That's why we don't need this kind of thing

135
00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:34,960
We just don't need it.

136
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:38,060
That's just sophistry.

137
00:08:38,060 --> 00:08:39,420
For Ryo-chan,

138
00:08:39,420 --> 00:08:41,560
you'll wear it whether you like it or not.

139
00:08:44,260 --> 00:08:45,100
What is this

140
00:08:45,100 --> 00:08:46,700
this eerie atmosphere

141
00:08:49,420 --> 00:08:50,260
Stop it.

142
00:08:50,260 --> 00:08:52,460
Stop it, Reiko.

143
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:04,300
Not even a tank can stand up
to Reiko when she's furious.

144
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:08,220
But doesn't it look more like a proper cop?

145
00:09:08,700 --> 00:09:09,780
Hey, Maria-chan.

146
00:09:09,780 --> 00:09:11,960
I'm really happy.

147
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:12,800
Yeah, that's right.

148
00:09:13,300 --> 00:09:14,980
Senpai, you look cool.

149
00:09:14,980 --> 00:09:15,480
Hey.

150
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:18,760
Talking nonsense like that
whenever you feel like it!

151
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,060
Good morning.

152
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:25,760
Excuse me.

153
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:27,800
Looks like I got the wrong police box.

154
00:09:31,340 --> 00:09:33,480
Kameari Kōen-mae Police Box

155
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:35,520
What, it's not wrong after all.

156
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:38,600
Then please stop with the cheap gags.

157
00:09:39,540 --> 00:09:40,800
So it's Ryo after all.

158
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,040
I didn't know who it was.

159
00:09:44,180 --> 00:09:45,680
So that's what it was.

160
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:50,280
It's a bit of a shame
Reiko's miniskirt is gone, but

161
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:54,540
more than anything, the fact that Ryo
finally dressed like a proper officer

162
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:58,340
Thirty years as a police officer.

163
00:09:58,340 --> 00:10:01,720
Nothing could make Daijirō Ohara happier.

164
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:03,360
There's no need to cry.

165
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,220
Shut up.

166
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:07,780
How could you ever understand how I feel,
having you as a subordinate?

167
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:09,300
Besides,

168
00:10:10,140 --> 00:10:10,500
This.

169
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:12,700
What is this?

170
00:10:12,700 --> 00:10:14,780
You, after I said so much to you...

171
00:10:14,780 --> 00:10:17,340
You haven't written a single incident report since last month,
have you?

172
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:21,660
You'd better write two months'
worth by the end of today.

173
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:23,000
Yes, yes.

174
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:28,000
Yes! Ryotsu Kankichi will
write his incident report, sir!

175
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:30,620
Good, very good.

176
00:10:30,620 --> 00:10:31,640
What

177
00:10:32,980 --> 00:10:36,620
Then, Ryotsu, once you've finished the report,
bring it to the station, got it?

178
00:10:36,620 --> 00:10:40,980
I should be heading back too.
Well, Ryo-sama, do your best.

179
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:44,500
I'm off on patrol. Senpai, Reiko-san,
I'm leaving the rest to you.

180
00:10:44,500 --> 00:10:45,880
Take care.

181
00:10:45,880 --> 00:10:53,120
Ugh, honestly. Wearing socks makes your feet all sweaty,
and that's terrible.

182
00:10:54,540 --> 00:10:55,400
Give me some tea.

183
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:58,020
If you want tea, help yourself.

184
00:10:58,540 --> 00:11:01,140
What's the big deal?
You could at least pour it for me!

185
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:04,500
I still haven't gotten used to this skirt,
so it's hard to move in.

186
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:06,880
It would've been better if it were a mini.

187
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:10,080
So from today, do things for yourself.

188
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:12,360
Then don't wear that skirt.

189
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:13,960
What are you talking about?

190
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:16,500
You're the one who told me not to wear minis,
Ryo-chan.

191
00:11:17,860 --> 00:11:18,900
Fine, fine.

192
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,640
I'll just pour it myself, then.

193
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:21,560
Myself.

194
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:25,240
Hey, Reiko. Where's the teapot?

195
00:11:25,420 --> 00:11:26,760
It's right there, isn't it?

196
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:30,120
Ah ah where's the tea leaves?

197
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:32,192
Ugh, you're so annoying.
It's in the cupboard.

198
00:11:32,242 --> 00:11:35,960
You said you'd do it yourself,
so stop asking me every little thing.

199
00:11:36,300 --> 00:11:39,080
I know, I know. You're the one being loud.

200
00:11:44,700 --> 00:11:46,660
Damn it, this is such a pain.

201
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,342
Mm, there we go,

202
00:11:54,392 --> 00:11:57,020
that took me a whole day.

203
00:11:57,020 --> 00:11:58,420
But it's finished!

204
00:11:59,100 --> 00:12:00,020
Yay!

205
00:12:06,040 --> 00:12:07,940
What's with all the yelling?

206
00:12:07,940 --> 00:12:10,460
Phil, it's your fault for
making me wear this outfit.

207
00:12:10,460 --> 00:12:14,080
My incident report that I worked so
hard on is soaking wet now, dammit!

208
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:19,180
Don't blame other people.
It's your own fault!

209
00:12:19,940 --> 00:12:20,660
What is it?

210
00:12:43,660 --> 00:12:46,800
Rewriting my incident
report took me until dawn.

211
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:50,600
And this uniform and cap are a bit too big,
aren't they?

212
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:54,440
Reiko, you brought a bigger size than mine on purpose,
didn't you?

213
00:12:54,660 --> 00:12:55,040
Whoa!

214
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:57,260
Ugh ah ah tch!

215
00:12:59,180 --> 00:13:00,017
Ugh, damn it.

216
00:13:00,067 --> 00:13:03,320
Why do I have to go through this?

217
00:13:04,700 --> 00:13:07,884
Honestly, because of this uniform,

218
00:13:07,934 --> 00:13:10,360
it's terribly hard to move in.

219
00:13:11,020 --> 00:13:12,180
Heh heh.

220
00:13:12,620 --> 00:13:14,500
I've got blisters.
I can't take this anymore.

221
00:13:14,500 --> 00:13:15,760
Already giving up?

222
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:23,300
Shut up, I was just taking a little break.

223
00:13:23,300 --> 00:13:27,220
Never mind me, you look like you're
having a hard time walking too.

224
00:13:27,660 --> 00:13:28,980
That's not true at all.

225
00:13:28,980 --> 00:13:32,060
I'm quite fond of being
able to walk so gracefully.

226
00:13:32,060 --> 00:13:35,020
I wonder how long that'll last, you tomboy.

227
00:13:35,020 --> 00:13:38,240
I'm going to stick with this from now on.

228
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:41,600
Ryo-chan, I wonder how long
you'll keep that outfit up.

229
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:45,280
Yeah, I actually like mine quite a bit too.

230
00:13:45,280 --> 00:13:49,020
It somehow straightens my
back and makes me feel focused.

231
00:13:49,860 --> 00:13:52,420
Well, I'm glad to hear it. See you.

232
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:57,520
Hey, as if it makes you feel focused!

233
00:13:58,640 --> 00:14:00,120
I forgot to mention something.

234
00:14:01,500 --> 00:14:03,120
What now?
You still have something to complain about?

235
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:06,840
The Chief says to hurry up and bring
your incident report to the station.

236
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:08,600
So, you know.

237
00:14:09,840 --> 00:14:11,560
Yeah, yeah, got it.

238
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:21,200
It's still hard to walk in this tight skirt.

239
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:24,080
Hello, Grandpa.

240
00:14:24,540 --> 00:14:26,480
Reiko-chan, what happened to you?

241
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:29,140
Wearing a long skirt like this.

242
00:14:29,140 --> 00:14:29,738
Well, I...

243
00:14:29,788 --> 00:14:33,520
I was looking forward to
seeing Reiko-chan's thighs.

244
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:35,940
You're such a silly old man.

245
00:14:35,940 --> 00:14:37,180
That's right, that's right.

246
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:40,820
When I look at those
bursting-with-life thighs,

247
00:14:40,820 --> 00:14:43,260
I really feel like I'm alive.

248
00:14:43,260 --> 00:14:47,760
Everyone in our senior citizens'
club is a fan of Reiko-chan's thighs.

249
00:14:48,280 --> 00:14:48,600
No way.

250
00:14:49,260 --> 00:14:51,240
If you go and wear a skirt like that,

251
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:54,460
some old geezer might
drop dead from the shock.

252
00:14:54,460 --> 00:14:56,200
You're exaggerating.

253
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:58,160
No, I'm not exaggerating.

254
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:03,080
It's not right to take away
the joy of us old folks.

255
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:05,720
Shouldn't you switch back to a mini skirt?

256
00:15:06,100 --> 00:15:07,580
Why are you following me?

257
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:10,720
This is the shortest way,
so there's no helping it.

258
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:14,320
Reiko-chan, are you a rookie cop?

259
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,840
Where are you looking,
you taiyaki old geezer?

260
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:19,900
It's me, it's me, Ryotsu!

261
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:22,040
It really is Ryo-san!

262
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:24,300
What on earth happened to your outfit?

263
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:26,220
He's even wearing shoes!

264
00:15:26,220 --> 00:15:28,280
Are you entering some
kind of costume contest?

265
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:28,620
Shut up!

266
00:15:29,400 --> 00:15:32,560
A cop dressed as a cop,
how is that a costume contest?

267
00:15:32,560 --> 00:15:34,380
I'm gonna arrest you bastards!

268
00:15:34,380 --> 00:15:34,840
Aaaaaah!

269
00:15:36,040 --> 00:15:38,960
Ryo-chan, don't push yourself.
Why not go back to your usual outfit?

270
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,940
Mind your own business.

271
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:41,620
It's Goto.

272
00:15:45,020 --> 00:15:45,760
Reiko.

273
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:49,320
Wait!

274
00:15:53,100 --> 00:15:54,600
This police force is screwed.

275
00:16:02,900 --> 00:16:04,760
I can't run properly in this skirt!

276
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:09,000
My damn feet hurt too much to run!

277
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:13,860
What are you doing, Ryo-chan?
He's going to get away!

278
00:16:13,860 --> 00:16:16,320
You're the one who needs to pick up the pace,
damn it!

279
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:22,720
Hey, that's dangerous!

280
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,380
Ryo-san?

281
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:25,080
Vroom!

282
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,860
Hey! I'm borrowing this bike!

283
00:16:27,420 --> 00:16:29,540
With this, the problem's solved!

284
00:16:30,620 --> 00:16:33,420
Ryo-san!
I'm still in the middle of a delivery!

285
00:16:33,660 --> 00:16:34,400
Sorry about that!

286
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:37,280
There he is!

287
00:16:38,380 --> 00:16:42,300
You think you can escape
from Kankichi Ryotsu Ugh!

288
00:16:42,380 --> 00:16:43,800
Ugh, my blisters!

289
00:16:44,280 --> 00:16:47,940
Me, the man they call
"The Steel Man," undone by a little blister...

290
00:16:47,940 --> 00:16:49,900
Damn...

291
00:16:50,980 --> 00:16:54,280
And the handlebars... I can't see ahead!

292
00:17:02,620 --> 00:17:04,640
What are you doing, Ryo-chan!
Where's the suspect?

293
00:17:05,820 --> 00:17:07,000
You're such a klutz!

294
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:11,460
Damn it, it's because of this outfit!

295
00:17:14,320 --> 00:17:15,980
I quit, I quit, I quit!

296
00:17:19,840 --> 00:17:21,880
These worn-out toilet sandals...

297
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:24,200
I knew these would make me cry.

298
00:17:25,300 --> 00:17:26,280
Get back here!

299
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:36,720
She's still following us!

300
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:38,640
What a fast woman!

301
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:50,180
He's over there!

302
00:17:50,900 --> 00:17:52,120
We don't have time to hesitate!

303
00:17:57,660 --> 00:17:58,440
Reiko

304
00:18:04,300 --> 00:18:05,260
We can't let him get away.

305
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:07,920
Right, I'm going too.

306
00:18:14,040 --> 00:18:15,120
S-sorry!

307
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:17,900
Idiot! Where are you looking while running?!

308
00:18:18,420 --> 00:18:21,320
But you fell right out of the sky!

309
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:22,240
Shut up!

310
00:18:22,660 --> 00:18:24,440
Because of you, we lost sight of him!

311
00:18:28,800 --> 00:18:29,400
Hello?

312
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:30,100
Ryo-chan

313
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:31,220
It's Reiko.

314
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:33,100
Contact a patrol car right away.

315
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:35,780
I'll keep following and
let you know our location.

316
00:18:35,780 --> 00:18:37,560
Keep the phone line open.

317
00:18:38,220 --> 00:18:39,920
Okay, I'll get in touch with them.

318
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:41,560
You be careful too.

319
00:18:41,560 --> 00:18:42,080
Yeah!

320
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:45,580
This is Ryotsu from the
Kameari Kōen-mae police box.

321
00:18:45,580 --> 00:18:48,960
We're currently chasing the robber who hit
the convenience store on the shopping street.

322
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:50,240
We need backup immediately.

323
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:53,040
Roger, please tell us your location.

324
00:18:56,540 --> 00:18:58,500
Damn, she's still following me!

325
00:18:58,500 --> 00:19:00,440
Hah, it's just a woman.

326
00:19:01,460 --> 00:19:02,900
Fine, then just keep following me.

327
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:07,340
She's climbing the utility pole!

328
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:11,860
I can't climb in this skirt!

329
00:19:13,800 --> 00:19:14,140
Fine!

330
00:19:21,980 --> 00:19:23,680
Ugh, these things are so restrictive!

331
00:19:26,020 --> 00:19:26,960
I won't let him get away!

332
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,840
Unbelievable, she's coming up!

333
00:19:31,100 --> 00:19:32,660
What are you doing!
Hurry up and get over here!

334
00:19:32,740 --> 00:19:33,260
Right!

335
00:19:38,200 --> 00:19:41,880
Ryo-chan! The suspect's
heading south from Nasubi Bank!

336
00:19:42,520 --> 00:19:44,680
Okay! South from the bank, got it!

337
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:46,740
Hey, turn left at the next corner!

338
00:19:46,940 --> 00:19:47,600
Y-yes!

339
00:19:57,200 --> 00:19:59,220
She's still following me! What a woman!

340
00:20:10,340 --> 00:20:12,080
Looks like we're saying
goodbye to Mr. Fukei here.

341
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:13,160
Thanks for your hard work.

342
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:19,860
Those two actually went and jumped down.

343
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:21,820
And she's wearing a skirt, too.

344
00:20:21,820 --> 00:20:23,380
I'm done helping, then.

345
00:20:32,940 --> 00:20:34,880
My legs are numb today.

346
00:20:35,840 --> 00:20:37,180
From that height...

347
00:20:41,860 --> 00:20:43,180
This time, I'm the one who has to jump.

348
00:20:43,920 --> 00:20:46,120
Running off only to the places women are bad at,
how low.

349
00:20:46,120 --> 00:20:47,040
Worst.

350
00:20:47,040 --> 00:20:48,240
I won't lose.

351
00:20:51,800 --> 00:20:53,520
A vile man like that

352
00:20:55,080 --> 00:20:56,340
I'll never forgive him.

353
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:04,200
After spending a whole hour shampooing!

354
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:06,540
Aaaaah!

355
00:21:07,580 --> 00:21:08,660
Where's the other one?

356
00:21:09,880 --> 00:21:10,720
Aaaaah!

357
00:21:14,200 --> 00:21:16,940
Just as I thought, it's the enemy.
That Bakemongar woman.

358
00:21:17,360 --> 00:21:19,700
Where did she get that
strength in such a slender body?

359
00:21:23,300 --> 00:21:24,940
Got you, Goto-san.

360
00:21:26,320 --> 00:21:29,040
Now, give up quietly and get arrested!

361
00:21:30,220 --> 00:21:30,860
This...

362
00:21:40,580 --> 00:21:42,520
You underestimated us because we're women.

363
00:21:44,200 --> 00:21:44,800
Gah -

364
00:21:44,800 --> 00:21:47,880
Heh heh heh, too bad, Mr. Filthy.

365
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:51,080
I figured something like this might happen,
so we split up.

366
00:21:51,080 --> 00:21:52,120
It hurts...

367
00:21:52,120 --> 00:21:54,380
Hey, how long are you going to lie there?

368
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:57,560
I heard about you, sis.
You've got quite a body.

369
00:21:58,120 --> 00:22:00,220
I'm going to give you a proper thank-you.

370
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,580
Eido!

371
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:10,160
Whoa!

372
00:22:11,540 --> 00:22:12,140
What?

373
00:22:13,140 --> 00:22:14,260
Aaaaaah!

374
00:22:14,260 --> 00:22:15,580
Aaaaaah!

375
00:22:15,580 --> 00:22:16,300
Aaaaaah!

376
00:22:16,300 --> 00:22:17,100
Aaaaaah!

377
00:22:17,100 --> 00:22:17,560
Aaaaaah!

378
00:22:30,040 --> 00:22:34,800
Was Lego-daijoubu in a bit of a pinch there?

379
00:22:38,700 --> 00:22:40,280
Come on, get in quickly.

380
00:22:40,280 --> 00:22:41,040
Shut up.

381
00:22:41,040 --> 00:22:43,660
Damn it,
if it weren't for that parent over there...

382
00:22:47,180 --> 00:22:49,440
Nice work, Reiko, you did great.

383
00:22:49,440 --> 00:22:50,540
Here, a towel.

384
00:22:51,040 --> 00:22:51,400
Thanks.

385
00:22:52,280 --> 00:22:54,480
Ryo-chan,
you were the one with the nice backup.

386
00:22:55,340 --> 00:22:56,720
Reiko, you...

387
00:22:57,080 --> 00:22:57,440
What?

388
00:22:57,880 --> 00:22:59,640
It's your outfit.

389
00:22:59,640 --> 00:23:00,640
My outfit?

390
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:02,900
Isn't it the same as the
clothes you had before?

391
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:07,180
But you're one to talk, Ryo-chan.

392
00:23:07,900 --> 00:23:09,020
This one?

393
00:23:09,760 --> 00:23:10,740
Just kidding.

394
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:15,480
Reiko, you really do look
better in a mini skirt.

395
00:23:16,300 --> 00:23:19,040
Ryo-chan,
you really should stick with that look, too.

396
00:23:35,980 --> 00:23:37,920
It's Reiko-chan.

397
00:23:38,420 --> 00:23:39,980
Good morning, grandpa.

398
00:23:39,980 --> 00:23:42,580
So you went back to your
regular uniform again

399
00:23:42,580 --> 00:23:46,220
Reiko-chan really does look best in a miniskirt,
you know.

400
00:23:46,220 --> 00:23:48,580
Yes, yes, nambandabu, nambandabu.

401
00:23:48,580 --> 00:23:50,560
Well, you're getting to be an old man,
aren't you.

402
00:23:51,060 --> 00:23:51,500
Well then.

403
00:23:54,100 --> 00:23:57,620
Hey, Reiko-chan, number one in all of Japan!

404
00:24:17,220 --> 00:24:23,620
Make some noise,
solve it with spirit, help out quickly.

405
00:24:25,560 --> 00:24:33,880
Decided, inspired, bouncing,
wrapped up, taking action.

406
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:40,080
Soaring off, the most amazing power of all.

407
00:24:40,080 --> 00:24:52,360
Gather everyone, come here,
the dreamlike final energy.

408
00:24:53,380 --> 00:25:03,480
Gazing at tomorrow, believing in yesterday, painting the universe,
standing on the ground, the star of Kameari comes spinning around, drawing a circle.

409
00:25:05,540 --> 00:25:07,140
This should be fine, right?

410
00:25:07,140 --> 00:25:08,600
Like hell it is!

411
00:25:20,820 --> 00:25:23,080
Senpai,
what are you doing inside the police box?

412
00:25:23,080 --> 00:25:25,320
Are you bending bamboo sticks
over a candle or something?

413
00:25:25,320 --> 00:25:26,760
And on top of that, inside the room there's

414
00:25:26,760 --> 00:25:29,400
old newspapers, matches, kerosene, gasoline,

415
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:30,920
dynamite, and missiles,

416
00:25:30,920 --> 00:25:32,900
piled up like a mountain, aren't there?

417
00:25:33,340 --> 00:25:33,960
Next time

418
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:36,020
Passing through the world with full energy.

419
00:25:36,020 --> 00:25:37,140
Please stop.

420
00:25:42,320 --> 00:25:43,720
Thank you for watching.

